401
01:24:02.298 --> 01:24:09.298
Where can I, as a priest, stand in the gap for someone who is in need at this moment.

402
01:24:10.298 --> 01:24:14.298
Shall we pray together that the Holy Spirit will help us in this this week?

403
01:24:15.298 --> 01:24:25.298
Thank You, Father, that You are our God. Thank You, Jesus, that You are our high priest, that You lead us in prayer.

404
01:24:26.298 --> 01:24:32.298
We want to join with You, Lord. Holy Spirit, we need You so desperately.

405
01:24:33.298 --> 01:24:37.298
Therefore come, Holy Spirit, again and again, every day this week.

406
01:24:38.298 --> 01:24:46.298
Take us to the inner room. Help us to seek You. Help us in praying.

407
01:24:47.298 --> 01:24:55.298
Release a passion and a burden for prayer, Lord. A passion for Jesus, but also a passion for praying.

408
01:24:56.298 --> 01:25:04.298
Help us, Lord, even if it is vacation time, not to slack off, but rather to pick up the thread again.

409
01:25:04.298 --> 01:25:09.298
Help us and encourage us and take us along, Holy Spirit, in prayer, in intercession.

410
01:25:10.298 --> 01:25:19.298
And know, even if you are in the midst of a struggle, even if you are still wrestling with sins, you don’t want to, but you fall back into it.

411
01:25:20.298 --> 01:25:28.298
But know, at the moment you say in your prayer, Father, I have done wrong again, forgive me.

412
01:25:28.298 --> 01:25:36.298
Know that at that moment you are completely forgiven, that you are washed, cleansed, whiter than snow.

413
01:25:37.298 --> 01:25:45.298
That God no longer sees your sins and your mistakes and know that at that moment you are also immediately in the full authority of the cross.

414
01:25:46.298 --> 01:25:51.298
And that the words you speak are powerful.

415
01:25:51.298 --> 01:25:58.298
Sometimes it is a real struggle, situations we are going through ourselves, where people around us are going through.

416
01:25:59.298 --> 01:26:06.298
Sometimes it can really be a struggle, but know that you stand in the authority of Jesus, through the cross.

417
01:26:07.298 --> 01:26:15.298
And therefore pray, knowing that what you pray is not just words and maybe something will change.

418
01:26:16.298 --> 01:26:19.298
But know, that prayer makes all the difference.

419
01:26:19.298 --> 01:26:22.298
Pray for people this week. Amen.
